OL,3,GNEWSAShellfish firms hope EU deal will
OL,4,A'lift a burden'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFood producers have welcomed a draft
OL,7,Fdeal between the UK and the EU which
OL,8,Fcould remove checks on exports that
OL,9,Fwere put in place after Brexit.
OL,11,FThe agreement should mean savings for
OL,12,Fthe shellfish industry in Bridlington,
OL,13,FEast Yorkshire, which exports lobster
OL,14,Fand crab to France, Spain and Portugal
OL,15,Fand generates at least #10m for the
OL,16,Flocal economy.
OL,18,FJo Ackers, from the Independent
OL,19,FShellfisherman's Co-operative, said it
OL,20,Fwould "lift a burden" from businesses
OL,21,Fexporting produce.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
